              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, the Justices questioned whether, after a denial of class certification, members of the dissolved class could pursue individual lawsuits."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "20bb41799be72e142719dd0b36bf2f59ebbdea9e08c217c8ee74d6c0c0c039ff",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-20bb41799be7-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, the Justices also asked about the appropriate representative under the statute, noting it should be the party with the greatest financial interest."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "20bb41799be72e142719dd0b36bf2f59ebbdea9e08c217c8ee74d6c0c0c039ff",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-20bb41799be7-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, further questions addressed whether the Court could treat numerous individual suits as a class despite statutes of limitations."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "20bb41799be72e142719dd0b36bf2f59ebbdea9e08c217c8ee74d6c0c0c039ff",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-20bb41799be7-0001-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, the Justices raised concerns about the applicability of equitable tolling and its consistency with the American Pipe precedent."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "20bb41799be72e142719dd0b36bf2f59ebbdea9e08c217c8ee74d6c0c0c039ff",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-20bb41799be7-0001-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, justice Ginsburg highlighted that Rule\u202f23 does not discuss tolling, referencing the Shady Grove case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "20bb41799be72e142719dd0b36bf2f59ebbdea9e08c217c8ee74d6c0c0c039ff",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-20bb41799be7-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 46,
              "start": 46
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer asked a clarifying question during the argument."
      }
